### Workarounds today

- Create an empty deployment, restore via Snapshot and Restore (not `restore_snapshot` on create), then delete the red searchable-snapshot indices (closing is not enough; closed indices still recover).
- Pause ILM deletes on the source for the whole snapshot+restore window; brittle, not a real DR plan.

### Out of scope / existing work

- [elasticsearch#98212](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/98212) - broader whole-cluster restore API / bootstrap; does not cover this failure mode.
- [elasticsearch#73947](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/73947) - prevent deleting a snapshot that is still mounted (source-cluster protection, not restore skip).
- [enhancements#28840](https://github.com/elastic/enhancements/issues/28840) - ECH restore observability (why create-from-snapshot is stuck), not skip-on-restore.
- [cp-hosted-team#3863](https://github.com/elastic/cp-hosted-team/issues/3863) - ECH wait-for-green hang.

