When I'm pasting this URL in the Kibana dev console of another cluster, I'm getting the following error:

```json
{
  "error": {
    "root_cause": [
      {
        "type": "x_content_parse_exception",
        "reason": "[1:254] [reindex] failed to parse field [source]"
      }
    ],
    "type": "x_content_parse_exception",
    "reason": "[1:254] [reindex] failed to parse field [source]",
    "caused_by": {
      "type": "illegal_argument_exception",
      "reason": "[host] must be of the form [scheme]://[host]:[port](/[pathPrefix])? but was [https://MY-CLUSTER.ingest.us-central1.gcp.elastic-cloud.com/_es]",
      "caused_by": {
        "type": "u_r_i_syntax_exception",
        "reason": "The port was not defined in the [host]: https://MY-CLUSTER.ingest.us-central1.gcp.elastic-cloud.com/_es"
      }
    }
